    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29361b903ee8372777106f64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要先回营地一趟，\n训练员要一起来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6236de0d606aa5396b31bc256f785870f9e88c670d261cf47c4368cbc5ed9d58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2304b4fa2f20066cf37ba426",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "远离热闹的市区，在安静的山上自给自足──\n像这样忘记时间生活，\n就会觉得自己好像也成为了大自然的一部分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e35be375258792d7d881eb5258c59bb8b5992631ffbaa943fe93f7aeb3f0337",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:014568d0eac906f2289f5d58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真庆幸今天有来",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc878a331ec51fd33c0104d1ae5716d7c4fc392d23a702c4052b9c457a0a6a25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94af2a750ec5fff08fc5b39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还不想回去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4365ea396c039f748c022708828840c956b4115ecfa4911e94a990d8d38f5e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057515.json",
