    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b002d4d7ee985c0e09a68792",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，那要就这样住在山里吗？\n晚上的山很危险喔。\n有时候天气会很差──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea1fd697f583e4d2c49ceaa012d672a817a3999147f400ee67e387741c286d89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
